==Legacy==
{{Quote|Sincere thanks must go to my family and especially my mother who may not have realised what me buying ''Star Wars: Specter of the Past'' in a bookshop in Florida in 1997 would lead to. Or perhaps she did. But she supported me all the way regardless.|Chris Kempshall, in the acknowledgements section of ''The Rise and Fall of the Galactic Empire''|<ref name="Rise and Fall">''[[Star Wars: The Rise and Fall of the Galactic Empire]]''</ref>}}
[[Chris Kempshall]] purchased a copy of ''Specter of the Past'' in 1997, which led to him eventually writing ''Star Wars'' books, beginning with<ref name="Rise and Fall" /> co-writing the [[2017]] [[canon]] reference book ''[[Star Wars: Battles that Changed the Galaxy]]''.<ref name="Battles">''[[Star Wars: Battles that Changed the Galaxy]]''</ref> He credited the influence of Zahn's novel in the acknowledgements section of his [[2024]] [[in-universe]] reference book ''[[Star Wars: The Rise and Fall of the Galactic Empire]]''.<ref name="Rise and Fall" />

